{"id":12591,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/there-it/","parentId":540,"order":174,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"There or It","seo":{"title":"There or It - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use 'there' and 'it' correctly in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1%E2%80%93Grammar_there-or-it.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T18:38:16","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct <em>there</em> or <em>it</em> forms to complete the following sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"595\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct <em>there</em> or <em>it</em> forms.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"596\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences using <em>there</em>, <em>it</em> or <em>they</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"597\"></div>"],"explanation":"<p><img src=\"/media/uploads/There-it_Grammar-chart.webp\" alt=\"Grammar chart distinguishing the use of 'There' and 'It' in English sentences, with correct and incorrect usage examples.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29182\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>There</h2> <p>We use <strong><a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/there-is-there-are/\">there</a></strong> to say when or where something is.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>There are</strong></span> some dirty cups on the table.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>There is</strong></span> a party tomorrow.</em></li> </ul> <p>We use <strong>there</strong> to say that something exists or is happening.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>There is</strong></span> a problem.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>There was</strong></span> an accident.</em></li> </ul> <p><span class=\"highlighter\">Note</span> that we use <strong>there</strong> the first time we mention something. If we talk about the same thing again, we use <strong>it</strong> or <strong>they</strong>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>There are</strong></span> some cups on the table. But <span><strong>they</strong></span> are dirty.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>There was</strong></span> an accident. <span><strong>It</strong></span> was horrible.</em></li> </ul> <h2>It</h2> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>it</strong> to talk about something again in the conversation.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>There is a party tomorrow. <span><strong>It</strong></span> will be fantastic!</em></li> <li><em>We saw a snake in the forest. <span><strong>It</strong></span> was very big.</em></li> </ul> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>it</strong> to talk about times and dates.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s my mum’s birthday today.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>Let’s go home. <span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s very late.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s four o’clock.</em></li> </ul> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>it</strong> to talk about the weather.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s very windy.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s a nice day.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span> rained a lot yesterday.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s four degrees.</em></li> </ul> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>it</strong> to talk about distance.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>How far is <span><strong>it</strong></span>?</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s not very far.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s a long way to the nearest petrol station.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It</strong></span>‘s 2 kilometres from the hotel to the station.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>❗ <strong>Note</strong> that we use&nbsp;<strong>far</strong> in negative sentences and questions, and we use&nbsp;<strong>a long way</strong> in affirmative sentences.</p> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>it’s + </strong>adjective<strong> + to-</strong>infinitive.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>It’s nice to see</strong></span> you again.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>It was difficult to find</strong></span> the hotel.</em></li> </ul> <h2>Be careful with these common mistakes!</h2> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><span><em><span>I think the worst part of the exam <span><strong>it’s speaking</strong></span>.</span></em></span><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><span><em><span>I think the worst part of the exam <strong><span>is speaking</span></strong></span>.</em></span><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <p>We do NOT use&nbsp;<strong>it</strong>&nbsp;when the subject of the verb is in the sentence. In the sentence above, the subject of&nbsp;<strong>is</strong>&nbsp;is ‘the worst part of the exam’.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><span><em>I love their music. <span><strong>Is fantastic</strong></span>!</em></span><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><span><em>I love their music. <span><strong>It’s fantastic</strong></span>!</em></span><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <p>Don’t forget to use <strong>it</strong> when you mention something again in the conversation.</p>","quizzes":[{"id":595,"questions":[{"id":5089,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is dangerous to drive at night. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["It","There"]}]},{"id":5090,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I opened the door and <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> was a strange man behind it.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["it","there"]}]},{"id":5091,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> was a problem with the car. We took a taxi.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["It","There"]}]},{"id":5092,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I want to go home. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>'s late and I'm tired. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["It","There"]}]},{"id":5093,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> aren't any students in the classroom.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["They","There"]}]},{"id":5094,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm watching a new series. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>'s very good. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["It","There"]}]},{"id":5095,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is very cold today. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["There","It"]}]},{"id":5096,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is a new teacher at my school.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["It","There"]}]},{"id":5097,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There's a park opposite my house. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is beautiful. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["It","There"]}]},{"id":5098,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They are in the classroom. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is an exam now. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["There","It"]}]}]},{"id":596,"questions":[{"id":5099,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>____ was sunny when we arrived.</div>","choices":[{"id":8049,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8050,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5100,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ is a long way from here to the shops.</div>","choices":[{"id":8051,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8052,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5101,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Is _____ any milk in the fridge?</div>","choices":[{"id":8053,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>there </span>"},{"id":8054,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>it</span>"}]},{"id":5102,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We didn't understand. _____ was a lot of confusion. </div>","choices":[{"id":8055,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There </span>"},{"id":8056,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5103,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Go back to sleep. _____ 's early. </div>","choices":[{"id":8057,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8058,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5104,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ snows a lot in winter.</div>","choices":[{"id":8059,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8060,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5105,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ was a terrible fire last year. </div>","choices":[{"id":8061,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8062,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5106,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ is important to answer all the questions.</div>","choices":[{"id":8063,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8064,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5107,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Let's not go to the park. _____ is very windy today. </div>","choices":[{"id":8065,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There</span>"},{"id":8066,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]},{"id":5108,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ is a concert this weekend.</div>","choices":[{"id":8067,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>There </span>"},{"id":8068,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>It</span>"}]}]},{"id":597,"questions":[{"id":5109,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> were a lot of people at the party.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5111,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> are two new students in my class. <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> are from Brazil. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5110,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Can you give me my bag? <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is on the sofa. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5113,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Are <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> any good hotels in this town?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5112,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is late and <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> are a lot of things that I need to do. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5115,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There's a new swimming pool. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>'s very big.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5116,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is so nice to be here. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5117,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I saw two people outside. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> were my parents. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5114,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is very late. How far is <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5118,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> were some problems last week. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}